    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not personally, but if someone with a low math confidence tried an AI tutor like Duolingo’s math solver, I’d imagine it might help break problems into digestible parts—like visualizing equations through drag-and-drop steps. My painting hobby reminds me that math is also creative expression; pairing AI with art tools could bridge my interest in both.",
